stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> Received
  Received --> Validated: schema + scope + evidence
  Validated --> Proposed: diff against baseline
  Proposed --> InReview: owner + policy
  InReview --> Approved: action-bound approval
  InReview --> Rejected: decision + rationale
  InReview --> Deferred: trigger recorded
  Approved --> Committed: governed Git write
  Committed --> ProjectRequested: durable event
  ProjectRequested --> Completed: receipt
  Validated --> Conflicted: material conflict
  Approved --> Proposed: baseline or diff changed
  Committed --> CompletedWithDegradedProjection: refresh failed

